 "sources": [
  "Maintainer evidence, live install and Restore of the final 0.9.0 package (2026-10-19): echo-step3-preview.out (install.py preview: the paths it manages in Echo Point Nova) and the Steam launch options before (echo-s2) and after (echo-s3) the install",
  "The 0.9.0 package's manifest.json (its payload/ files and opti/OptiScaler.dll)",
  "packaging/dependencies.json (runtime ProxyPackage layout, the fresh-setup and DLSS downloads)",
  "packaging/install.py install() (dxgi.dll in a fresh setup, an existing OptiScaler's name kept, the backup folder) and packaging/launcher_config.py environment() (the launcher variables)",
  "The 1.0.0 package's manifest.json: the same payload as 0.9.0's plus five shaders (BC250-XeFG/shaders/mfg-finish*.dxil, the multi-frame network's last layer), a different libxess_fg.dll and opti/OptiScaler.dll (the fork's build of OptiScaler master of 19 October 2026); the file layout is otherwise 0.9.0's"
 ]
